fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"codecparsers/gsth266parser.html#GstH266LMCS","fragment":"\n\tGstH266LMCS\n\nMembers\n\n\tGstCodecParsers.H266LMCS\n\nMembers\n\n\tGstCodecParsers.H266LMCS\n\nMembers\nStructure defining the H266 LMCS parameters.\nminimum bin index used in the luma mapping with chroma scaling\nconstruction process.\nspecifies the delta value between 15 and the maximum bin\nindex LmcsMaxBinIdx used in the luma mapping with chroma scaling construction\nprocess.\nspecifies the number of bits used for the\nrepresentation of the syntax lmcs_delta_abs_cw[i].\nspecifies the absolute delta codeword value for the ith bin.\nspecifies the sign of the variable lmcsDeltaCW[i].\nspecifies the absolute codeword value of the variable\nlmcsDeltaCrs.\nspecifies the sign of the variable lmcsDeltaCrs.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\nStructure defining the H266 LMCS parameters.\nminimum bin index used in the luma mapping with chroma scaling\nconstruction process.\nspecifies the delta value between 15 and the maximum bin\nindex LmcsMaxBinIdx used in the luma mapping with chroma scaling construction\nprocess.\nspecifies the number of bits used for the\nrepresentation of the syntax lmcs_delta_abs_cw[i].\nspecifies the absolute delta codeword value for the ith bin.\nspecifies the sign of the variable lmcsDeltaCW[i].\nspecifies the absolute codeword value of the variable\nlmcsDeltaCrs.\nspecifies the sign of the variable lmcsDeltaCrs.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\nStructure defining the H266 LMCS parameters.\nminimum bin index used in the luma mapping with chroma scaling\nconstruction process.\nspecifies the delta value between 15 and the maximum bin\nindex LmcsMaxBinIdx used in the luma mapping with chroma scaling construction\nprocess.\nspecifies the number of bits used for the\nrepresentation of the syntax lmcs_delta_abs_cw[i].\nspecifies the absolute delta codeword value for the ith bin.\nspecifies the sign of the variable lmcsDeltaCW[i].\nspecifies the absolute codeword value